### Create a knowledge document and index its chunks
POST {{host}}/api/knowledge
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=KnowledgeBoundary

--KnowledgeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sliding-window.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../src/main/resources/knowledge/fictional/tide-compress.md
--KnowledgeBoundary--

### Get a knowledge document
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/{{knowledgeDocumentId}}
Accept: application/json

### List stored knowledge documents
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge?limit=12
Accept: application/json
